{"id": "UgzhfGr6oiWVing2-ZN4AaABAg.A_EwTdo_Bw_A_qnMCCPAZL", "parent": "UgzhfGr6oiWVing2-ZN4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "​@윤영숙-i9y풍, 흐름을 잘 만드시네요, 편했습니다,", "published": "2026-08-23T10:37:03", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
